Description: Fix ReDoS vulnerability in archetype lexer
 The AdlLexer's GUID and ID patterns could be exploited with crafted input
 to cause excessive CPU usage via inefficient regular expression complexity.
 .
 This patch limits the length of repeated patterns to prevent ReDoS attacks.
Author: zam. <zamkorong12@gmail.com>
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/pygments/pygments/commit/24b8aa76c6cd6d70f39c6dd605cce319c98e2ccc
Bug: https://security-tracker.debian.org/tracker/CVE-2026-4539
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/1132233
Forwarded: not-needed

Index: github-pygments-CVE-2026-4539/pygments/lexers/archetype.py
